{"ref":"BDB, אֶלְעָשָׂה","hw":"אֶלְעָשָׂה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֶלְעָשָׂה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>God has made</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עֲשָׂהאֵל\" href=\"/BDB,_עֲשָׂהאֵל\", dir=\"rtl\">עֲשָׂהאֵל</a>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, יַעֲשִׂיאֵל\" href=\"/BDB,_יַעֲשִׂיאֵל\", dir=\"rtl\">יַעֲשִׂיאֵל</a> etc.<strong>) </strong><br><strong>a.</strong>  descendant of Judah <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:39\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.39\">1 Ch 2:39</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:40\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.40\">40</a>.<br><strong>b.</strong>  a Benjamite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:37\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.37\">1 Ch 8:37</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:43\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.43\">9:43</a>.<br><strong>c.</strong>  of the line of Pashur <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:22\" href=\"/Ezra.10.22\">Ezr 10:22</a>.<br><strong>d.</strong>  son of Shaphan <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 29:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.29.3\">Je 29:3</a>.","next":"BDB, אֶלְפֶּלֶט","prev":"BDB, אֶלְעָלֵא"}